From 06a3d6edfa4c3d026b187e097a95978ca2e6e0b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:49:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(motion): 2D Offset rings link in the plane, lift only
 with a named reason

Round a part, the start-side plan joins ring pieces through air as well
as cut material, and along the edge of the area where that edge is in
air. The pass link of a ring area stays in the plane where it is proved;
each lift is tallied with its reason (part, fixture, crossing, uncut
stock, stay-down limit).

Refs #3747

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
